  "definition": "Mutual Funds",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-08-12",
  "historyNote": "#4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04 (from Rev 902.05); ss by #9658, eff 2-24-10; ss by #9843, eff 12-23-10 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 900); ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; amd by #10795, eff 3-11-15; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
